{"id":"steam-1417650","steam":1417650,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Jaeger","summary":"Jaeger is a third-person MOBA and PvE (mission-mode progression) game featuring distinct character classes, a unique weapon system, and a dynamic combat system.","about":"Jaeger is a third-person Action MOBA  and PvE mode (Mission Mode progression) game. \r\n\n\r\n\nKey Features:\n\n\r\n\n• \n Character Class \n\nChoose from 8 distinct character classes: Sharpshooter, Berserker, Defender, Elementalist, Ranger, Barbarian, Knight, and Fire Wizzard. Each class features a unique weapon and specialized skills. \r\n\n• \nCharacter Progression (Mission Mode)\n\nIn a Mission Mode, players can level up and progress like an Action RPG games. Players can earn weapons and items in game.\n\n• \n Classic Leveling System ( Player Stats ) \n\nAs players level up, they can freely allocate stat points and learn new skills to customize their character. \r\n\n• \nUnique Weapons with Skills \n\nEach weapon boasts unique skills and specific requirements. Players can purchase weapons during a match.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417650/library_600x900.jpg?t=1795064699","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417650/0133a2058cd737499a47dfe1c8930e28b663e37c/header.jpg?t=1795064699","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417650/f3bde2126de02b9e32a3443c3af4c4218c9b6ab5/library_hero.jpg?t=1795064699","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417650/0133a2058cd737499a47dfe1c8930e28b663e37c/header.jpg?t=1795064699","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417650/b4627cb9d17903c7b0b3926249989d9ad3ed6783/ss_b4627cb9d17903c7b0b3926249989d9ad3ed6783.600x338.jpg?t=1795064699","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417650/b4627cb9d17903c7b0b